d2full 0001: SDL_GetKeyboardState/GetModState/GetMouseState and SDL_ConvertEventToRenderCoordinates are redirected (macros in wasm/full/shim/d2web.hpp) to our own tables, because SDL_PushEvent does not update SDL's polled state. One concern: platform.hpp includes the shim under D2WEB. Safe to upstream behind a platform hook; the macros live outside the tree.

--- a/apps/d2d/platform.hpp
+++ b/apps/d2d/platform.hpp
@@ -3,6 +3,9 @@
 #pragma once
 
 #include <SDL3/SDL.h>
+#ifdef D2WEB
+#  include "d2web.hpp"   // browser build: polled-state shims (wasm/full)
+#endif
 
 #if __has_include(<AL/al.h>)
 #  include <AL/al.h>
